{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04480","headline":"岘山怀古 · 陈子昂","name":"岘山怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秣马临荒甸，登高览旧都。\n犹悲堕泪碣，尚想卧龙图。\n城邑遥分楚，山川半入吴。\n丘陵徒自出，贤圣几凋枯。\n野树苍烟断，津楼晚气孤。\n谁知万里客，怀古正踌蹰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04480.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04480","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}